OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor found not guilty of
OL,4,Araping child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA serving councillor has been found not
OL,7,Fguilty of raping a child.
OL,9,FAshley Sorensen, an independent
OL,10,Fcouncillor in Lancashire, had been
OL,11,Fcharged with raping a girl under the
OL,12,Fage of 16 and seven counts of indecent
OL,13,Fassault against a girl under the age of
OL,14,F14.
OL,16,FThe 56-year-old, who represents the
OL,17,FPreesall ward on Wyre Council, pleaded
OL,18,Fnot guilty to all charges at an earlier
OL,19,Fhearing.
